provided skin-related context, and the SLM output should be processed rather than forwarded blindly.","newText":"description: Query a small language model (SLM) endpoint with dermatology expertise by asking a focused question about patient health data stored in records, skin symptoms, lesion descriptions, rash history, dermatology imaging context, or dermatology-relevant follow-up needs, then perform inference directly through /chat. Use when the agent needs a compact dermatology-specialist model pass over record-grounded or clearly provided skin-related context, and the SLM output should be processed rather than forwarded blindly."},{"oldText":"3. Load the dermatology adapter before every inference.\n   - Always do the adapter-load step immediately before the chat query.\n   - Run:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/query_slm_dermatology.py \"<question>\"\n```\n\n   - The script first sends this payload to the adapter-loading endpoint:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"model\": \"tinyllama\",\n  \"adapter_path\": \"adapters/derma_v1.0\",\n  \"mode\": \"derma\"\n}\n```\n\n   - Adapter endpoint:\n\n```text\nhttp://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/node/load-adapter\n```\n\n   - It then sends the inference payload:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"question\": \"<question>\"\n}\n```\n\n   - Chat endpoint:\n\n```text\nhttp://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/chat\n```\n\n4. Read the response.\n","newText":"3. Run inference directly through the chat endpoint.\n   - Run:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/query_slm_dermatology.py \"<question>\"\n```\n\n   - The script sends this inference payload:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"question\": \"<question>\"\n}\n```\n\n   - Chat endpoint:\n\n```text\nhttp://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/chat\n```\n\n4. Read the response.\n"}]},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/slm-dermatology/SKILL.md\",\"edits\":[{\"oldText\":\"description: Query a small language model (SLM) endpoint with dermatology expertise by asking a focused question about patient health data stored in records, skin symptoms, lesion descriptions, rash history, dermatology imaging context, or dermatology-relevant follow-up needs. Before each inference, first load the dermatology adapter with the fixed /node/load-adapter payload, then perform the query. Use when the agent needs a compact dermatology-specialist model pass over record-grounded or clearly provided skin-related context, and the SLM output should be processed rather than forwarded blindly.\",\"newText\":\"description: Query a small language model (SLM) endpoint with dermatology expertise by asking a focused question about patient health data stored in records, skin symptoms, lesion descriptions, rash history, dermatology imaging context, or dermatology-relevant follow-up needs, then perform inference directly through /chat. Use when the agent needs a compact dermatology-specialist model pass over record-grounded or clearly provided skin-related context, and the SLM output should be processed rather than forwarded blindly.\"},{\"oldText\":\"3. Load the dermatology adapter before every inference.\\n   - Always do the adapter-load step immediately before the chat query.\\n   - Run:\\n\\n```bash\\npython3 scripts/query_slm_dermatology.py \\\"<question>\\\"\\n```\\n\\n   - The script first sends this payload to the adapter-loading endpoint:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"model\\\": \\\"tinyllama\\\",\\n  \\\"adapter_path\\\": \\\"adapters/derma_v1.0\\\",\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"derma\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n   - Adapter endpoint:\\n\\n```text\\nhttp://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/node/load-adapter\\n```\\n\\n   - It then sends the inference payload:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"question\\\": \\\"<question>\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n   - Chat endpoint:\\n\\n```text\\nhttp://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/chat\\n```\\n\\n4. Read the response.\\n\",\"newText\":\"3. Run inference directly through the chat endpoint.\\n   - Run:\\n\\n```bash\\npython3 scripts/query_slm_dermatology.py \\\"<question>\\\"\\n```\\n\\n   - The script sends this inference payload:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"question\\\": \\\"<question>\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n   - Chat endpoint:\\n\\n```text\\nhttp://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/chat\\n```\\n\\n4. Read the response.\\n\"}]}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":628,"output":595,"cacheRead":21888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23111,"cost":{"input":0.0015700000000000002,"output":0.008925,"cacheRead":0.0054719999999999994,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015967000000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776854703326,"responseId":"resp_01b1a7377d3a77740169e8a6af8efc8191980b6f186a75d160"}}
{"type":"message","id":"05c1a38d","parentId":"1ff2ccea","timestamp":"2026-04-22T10:45:16.579Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PEsuOPFUM6G9ST7gGye52uOc|fc_01b1a7377d3a77740169e8a6b201e481919bc03c14d9536c76","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 2 block(s) in /home/node/.openclaw/skills/slm-dermatology/SKILL.md."}],"details":{"diff":"  1 ---\n  2 name: slm-dermatology\n- 3 description: Query a small language model (SLM) endpoint with dermatology expertise by asking a focused question about patient health data stored in records, skin symptoms, lesion descriptions, rash history, dermatology imaging context, or dermatology-relevant follow-up needs. Before each inference, first load the dermatology adapter with the fixed /node/load-adapter payload, then perform the query. Use when the agent needs a compact dermatology-specialist model pass over record-grounded or clearly provided skin-related context, and the SLM output should be processed rather than forwarded blindly.\n+ 3 description: Query a small language model (SLM) endpoint with dermatology expertise by asking a focused question about patient health data stored in records, skin symptoms, lesion descriptions, rash history, dermatology imaging context, or dermatology-relevant follow-up needs, then perform inference directly through /chat. Use when the agent needs a compact dermatology-specialist model pass over record-grounded or clearly provided skin-related context, and the SLM output should be processed rather than forwarded blindly.\n  4 ---\n  5 \n  6 # SLM Dermatology\n  7 \n    ...\n 24      - `From this patient record, what findings most strongly support inflammatory dermatitis rather than an infectious rash?`\n 25      - `What dermatology-focused differential diagnoses best fit this chronic pruritic plaque history?`\n 26      - `Which missing skin-history details would matter most before interpreting this pigmented lesion?`\n 27 \n-28 3. Load the dermatology adapter before every inference.\n-29    - Always do the adapter-load step immediately before the chat query.\n+28 3. Run inference directly through the chat endpoint.\n 30    - Run:\n 31 \n 32 ```bash\n 33 python3 scripts/query_slm_dermatology.py \"<question>\"\n 34 ```\n 35 \n-36    - The script first sends this payload to the adapter-loading endpoint:\n+35    - The script sends this inference payload:\n 37 \n 38 ```json\n 39 {\n-40   \"model\": \"tinyllama\",\n-41   \"adapter_path\": \"adapters/derma_v1.0\",\n-42   \"mode\": \"derma\"\n-43 }\n-44 ```\n-45 \n-46    - Adapter endpoint:\n-47 \n-48 ```text\n-49 http://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/node/load-adapter\n-50 ```\n-51 \n-52    - It then sends the inference payload:\n-53 \n-54 ```json\n-55 {\n 56   \"question\": \"<question>\"\n 57 }\n 58 ```\n 59 \n    ...","firstChangedLine":3},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776854716578}}
